{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34008","headline":"寄毘陵魏处士朴 · 皮日休","name":"寄毘陵魏处士朴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文籍先生不肯官，絮巾冲雪把鱼竿。\n一堆方册爲侯印，三级幽岩是将[坛]。\n醉少最因吟月冷，瘦多偏爲卧云寒。\n兔皮衾暖篷舟稳，欲共谁游七里滩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}